      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "上次活动以后，你觉得怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "很好，比我想的轻松。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "你还跟别人聊天了吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "聊了一点儿，不过还是跟你聊得最多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "没关系，第一次不用认识很多人。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我现在也这么觉得。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "你工作还顺利吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "越来越顺利。同事也很帮忙。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "我以前换工作的时候也花了几个月才习惯。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "听你这么说我放心多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "新环境都需要时间。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "生活也是。现在杭州越来越像家。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "那很好。你已经有自己的生活节奏了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "还差一点儿，就是朋友不算多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "慢慢来。朋友不用多，合得来更重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这句话我很喜欢。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "那下周有空一起去走路？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc042_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，到时候你选路线。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
